  m_Name: Camp_EveWrap_D15
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LessonQuizData
  kind: 1
  title: "T\u1EF1 ki\u1EC3m tra cu\u1ED1i h\u1ECDc k\u1EF3"
  intro: "N\u1ED9i dung tr\xF9ng v\u1EDBi nh\u1EEFng g\xEC \xF4n nh\xE0 v\xE0 l\xEAn
    l\u1EDBp s\u1EBD ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1EA1i."
  questions:
  - prompt: "Mu\u1ED1n \u1ED5n \u0111\u1ECBnh GPA c\u1EA3 h\u1ECDc k\u1EF3, \u0111i\u1EC1u
      n\xE0o n\xEAn l\xE0m \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EB7n nh\u1EA5t?"
    options:
    - "\u0110i h\u1ECDc v\xE0 \xF4n c\xF3 l\u1ECBch, tr\xE1nh ch\u1EC9 c\xE0y m\u1ED9t
      \u0111\xEAm"
    - "Ch\u1EC9 h\u1ECDc khi g\u1EA7n thi"
    - "B\u1ECF qua bu\u1ED5i s\xE1ng"
    - "Kh\xF4ng \xF4n nh\xE0 bu\u1ED5i t\u1ED1i"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "\xD4n t\u1ED1i v\xE0 ki\u1EC3m tra s\xE1ng c\xF9ng n\u1ED9i dung gi\xFAp
      g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Ghi nh\u1EDB s\xE2u h\u01A1n v\xE0 b\u1EDBt b\u1EA5t ng\u1EDD khi v\xE0o ph\xF2ng"
    - "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 t\xE1c d\u1EE5ng"
    - "T\u0103ng stress v\xF4 c\u1EDB"
    - "L\xE0m gi\u1EA3m k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng l\xE0m quiz"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "N\u1EBFu tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai trong bu\u1ED5i ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1EA1i
      bu\u1ED5i s\xE1ng, game s\u1EBD x\u1EED l\xFD th\u1EBF n\xE0o?"
    options:
    - "Tr\u1EEB GPA theo m\u1ED7i c\xE2u sai (v\xE0 c\xE1c hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng stat
      kh\xE1c theo preset)"
    - "Lu\xF4n t\u0103ng GPA"
    - "Kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\u1ED5i GPA"
    - "K\u1EBFt th\xFAc game lu\xF4n"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
